      "content": "it just feels so logical when you actually sit down and do the math. every cent i spend is more stress for them. even just the way i look at them... they deserve someone who isn't always so broken and struggling. it feels like the only way to actually be selfless is to just stop being a problem. do you think that's selfish of me to want to stay?",
